        ],
        "text": "{bpm: 90} {time: 3/4}\nG         G7        C*6\nWalking slow in waltz time,\nD7*1.5   C*1.5    G     NC\nstep and turn and home"
       },
       {
        "image": null,
        "kind": "text",
        "notation": null,
        "spans": [],
        "text": "Each chord lasts one bar unless you add *beats after it: C*6 holds for two bars of 3/4, D7*1.5 for a beat and a half. NC is a bar of silence. The song pill in the Play tab sets the tempo, key and time defaults for the whole song, and Speed slows it down for practice."
       }
      ],
      "title": "Tempo, Meter and Timing"
     },
     {
      "blocks": [
       {
        "image": null,
        "kind": "text",
        "notation": null,
        "spans": [],
        "text": "Name a section with {label: …} and repeat it with {loop: name times}. Lines starting with // are comments: they're notes for you and are never played."
       },
       {
        "image": null,
        "kind": "snippet",
        "notation": "american",
